      delaySeconds: 1
    editorPosition: {x: 0, y: 0}
  - guid: acca2cce-a6a3-48e7-b68a-a720740f9c3b
    kind: 0
    line:
      text: I still don't know how you did that by the way.
      delaySeconds: 0.4
    editorPosition: {x: 260, y: 0}
  - guid: f5101142-d010-4a6d-a036-c3c18d5af363
    kind: 0
    line:
      text: Dusty ass market cook turns out not just to be a beef boss, but a clairvoyant recipe thief, sending my brain reeling with some street food.
      delaySeconds: 2.7
    editorPosition: {x: 520, y: 0}
  - guid: 89d9fcab-ea65-4fdd-8981-c4c745aa3b93
    kind: 0
    line:
      text: Anyways... Your soup made me realise some things I should have realised a long time ago.
      delaySeconds: 6
    editorPosition: {x: 780, y: 0}
  - guid: 65f68da1-b3ad-4080-88f9-45a936f95488
    kind: 0
    line:
      text: All those cycles ago, I fucked up majorly.
      delaySeconds: 4.1
    editorPosition: {x: 1040, y: 0}
  - guid: e77e8fcb-1268-4c77-b740-842bab697e1f
    kind: 0
    line:
      text: I shouldn't have let her leave on her own, and though I might have fucked it permanently, I have to try and make things right.
      delaySeconds: 2.5
    editorPosition: {x: 1300, y: 0}
  - guid: 549ad2db-869b-4d7c-8b17-d87c48bae3a9
    kind: 0
    line:
      text: I have to make [name of her lover] her favourite soup once more.
      delaySeconds: 5.5
    editorPosition: {x: 1560, y: 0}
  - guid: 0b342e94-dceb-4365-b517-49cd464783aa
    kind: 0
    line:
      text: What I'm trying to say is thank you, I owe you one.
      delaySeconds: 3.3
    editorPosition: {x: 1820, y: 0}
  - guid: 6d0541bd-025f-4d4d-98fc-e8289168621d
    kind: 0
    line:
      text: But don't expect no tips from me. Especially now that I have to buy my way off this piece of metal.
      delaySeconds: 2.8
    editorPosition: {x: 2080, y: 0}
  - guid: 4f44a1b4-ea03-4e5a-bcef-d2d321774112
    kind: 4
    line:
      text: 
      delaySeconds: 1
    editorPosition: {x: 2340, y: 0}
